 },
 {
  "start": 680.153311,
  "end": 681.949252,
  "sil_before": [
   679.184649,
   680.153311
  ],
  "sil_after": [
   681.949252,
   691.895805
  ],
  "i": 125,
  "text": "which is exactly what the job looks like."
 },
 {
  "start": 691.895805,
  "end": 692.481678,
  "sil_before": [
   681.949252,
   691.895805
  ],
  "sil_after": [
   692.481678,
   693.19322
  ],
  "i": 126,
  "text": "One rule."
 },
 {
  "start": 693.19322,
  "end": 695.161111,
  "sil_before": [
   692.481678,
   693.19322
  ],
  "sil_after": [
   695.161111,
   695.929819
  ],
  "i": 127,
  "text": "and it decides whether any of this works."
 },
 {
  "start": 695.929819,
  "end": 697.842313,
  "sil_before": [
   695.161111,
   695.929819
  ],
  "sil_after": [
   697.842313,
   699.308345
  ],
  "i": 128,
  "text": "Most people learn Python by watching."
 },
 {
  "start": 699.308345,
  "end": 702.016145,
  "sil_before": [
   697.842313,
   699.308345
  ],
  "sil_after": [
   702.016145,
   702.45
  ],
  "i": 129,
  "text": "And you can sit through 40 hours of somebody else typing."
 },
 {
  "start": 702.45,
  "end": 703.929932,
  "sil_before": [
   702.016145,
   702.45
  ],
  "sil_after": [
   703.929932,
   710.72898
  ],
  "i": 130,
  "text": "I retained absolutely nothing."
 },
 {
  "start": 710.72898,
  "end": 712.329592,
  "sil_before": [
   703.929932,
   710.72898
  ],
  "sil_after": [
   712.329592,
   718.257324
  ],
  "i": 131,
  "text": "Watching is why people don't learn."
 },
 {
  "start": 718.257324,
  "end": 722.221066,
  "sil_before": [
   712.329592,
   718.257324
  ],
  "sil_after": [
   722.221066,
   722.554853
  ],
  "i": 132,
  "text": "So while you're building the foundations, AI is allowed to explain things to you."
 },
 {
  "start": 722.554853,
  "end": 723.264943,
  "sil_before": [
   722.221066,
   722.554853
  ],
  "sil_after": [
   723.264943,
   723.974082
  ],
  "i": 133,
  "text": "and quiz you."
 },
 {
  "start": 723.974082,
  "end": 725.520023,
  "sil_before": [
   723.264943,
   723.974082
  ],
  "sil_after": [
   725.520023,
   729.923628
  ],
  "i": 134,
  "text": "is not allowed to write your code."
 },
 {
  "start": 729.923628,
  "end": 731.728549,
  "sil_before": [
   725.520023,
   729.923628
  ],
  "sil_after": [
   731.728549,
   732.146213
  ],
  "i": 135,
  "text": "I mean, yeah, that's slower, but..."
 },
 {
  "start": 732.146213,
  "end": 733.626259,
  "sil_before": [
   731.728549,
   732.146213
  ],
  "sil_after": [
   733.626259,
   741.111678
  ],
  "i": 136,
  "text": "Again, that's really the point."
 },
 {
  "start": 741.111678,
  "end": 743.294308,
  "sil_before": [
   733.626259,
   741.111678
  ],
  "sil_after": [
   743.294308,
   750.785918
  ],
  "i": 137,
  "text": "And a struggle is the part where learning happens."
 },
 {
  "start": 750.785918,
  "end": 753.452109,
  "sil_before": [
   743.294308,
   750.785918
  ],
  "sil_after": [
   753.452109,
   754.957029
  ],
  "i": 138,
  "text": "You'll know you're through this phase when three things are true."
 },
 {
  "start": 754.957029,
  "end": 757.62644,
  "sil_before": [
   753.452109,
   754.957029
  ],
  "sil_after": [
   757.62644,
   758.498413
  ],
  "i": 139,
  "text": "You can read unfamiliar code and say what it does."
 },
 {
  "start": 758.498413,
  "end": 760.688209,
  "sil_before": [
   757.62644,
   758.498413
  ],
  "sil_after": [
   760.688209,
   761.338299
  ],
  "i": 140,
  "text": "you can debug a failing test on your own."
 },
 {
  "start": 761.338299,
  "end": 764.1161,
  "sil_before": [
   760.688209,
   761.338299
  ],
  "sil_after": [
   764.1161,
   766.641587
  ],
  "i": 141,
  "text": "you can look at a system and guess where it's gonna break."
 },
 {
  "start": 774.388435,
  "end": 777.635646,
  "sil_before": [
   766.725374,
   774.388435
  ],
  "sil_after": [
   777.635646,
   800.886599
  ],
  "i": 142,
  "text": "Hit those three and you've earned the right to let the AI drive."
 },
 {
  "start": 800.886599,
  "end": 804.422857,
  "sil_before": [
   777.635646,
   800.886599
  ],
  "sil_after": [
   804.422857,
   804.974127
  ],
  "i": 143,
  "text": "So if you want to learn Python for AI engineering, subscribe."
 },
 {
  "start": 804.974127,
  "end": 806.192925,
  "sil_before": [
   804.422857,
   804.974127
  ],
  "sil_after": [
   806.192925,
   811.195964
  ],
  "i": 144,
  "text": "and follow this playlist."
 },
 {
  "start": 811.195964,
  "end": 812.251542,
  "sil_before": [
   806.192925,
   811.195964
  ],
  "sil_after": [
   812.251542,
   812.884172
  ],
  "i": 145,
  "text": "I'll see you in the next one."
 }
]